{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quest of Dungeloria is a short metroidvania with elaborate locations. Forget about linear progression, the entire game world is a puzzle. The melancholy of a dying fantasy kingdom. Hardcore platforming, puzzles, bosses, gear items and a lot of secret places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623580/extras/Nonlinear_narrative+.gif?t=1743496126\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Nonlinear story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Communicate with the characters. Choose your response options. Kill, betray or spare. You are free to do whatever you want in this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623580/extras/Adventure-like+.gif?t=1743496126\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Adventure-like</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the spirit of classic adventure point-and-click games, solving some puzzles requires some item hunting. Talk to NPCs to gain valuable clues and piece together the history of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623580/extras/Equipment+.gif?t=1743496126\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Active items grant the hero unique abilities, such as double jumping, attacking monsters, seeing hidden walls and more. Quick swap your equipment on the fly to adapt to any situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623580/extras/Level-up_items+.gif?t=1743496126\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Item Swap</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Improve items in your inventory by finding flower pearls, giving you new gameplay options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623580/extras/Old_school+.gif?t=1743496126\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Old School gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progressively increasing difficulty ensures a properly hardcore experience. Quick reaction is king. No randomization, everything comes down to pure character control and focus.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2623580?t=1743496126","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623580/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743496126","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623580/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743496126","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623580/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743496126","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2902310,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quest of Dungeloria is a short metroidvania with elaborate locations. Forget about linear progression, the entire game world is a puzzle. The melancholy of a dying fantasy kingdom. Hardcore platforming, puzzles, bosses, gear items and a lot of secret places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623580/extras/Nonlinear_narrative+.gif?t=1743496126\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Nonlinear story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Communicate with the characters. Choose your response options. Kill, betray or spare. You are free to do whatever you want in this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shar